Adaptation_method:
Remove functions and symbols from objects passed to subprocess.send() or explicitly set the serialization option to 'json':

```diff
- subprocess.send({example: true, getExample() {}});
+ subprocess.send({example: true});
```

Or set the serialization option to 'json':

```js
const subprocess = execa('node', ['file.js'], {serialization: 'json'});
subprocess.send({example: true, getExample() {}}); // Functions will be removed silently
```
